  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1593311/description_15cbd96b-fa16-4cbe-b0c2-428cac8942c3.png\" width=\"200\">\n<h1>打包多區塊</h1>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"> \n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/packaged-multiblock\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1593311?style=flat-square&logo=curseforge&color=f16436\">\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpackaged-multiblock\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/packaged-multiblock?style=flat-square&logo=modrinth&color=00af5c\">\n</a>\n\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/mc-myo-s-mod/PackagedMultiBlock?style=flat-square\">\n\n</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>將龐大的多區塊材料清單，轉化為整齊且可製作的包裝物品。</li>\n<li>新增多區塊包裝機，支援類似 PackagedAuto 的能量、進度與自動化機制。</li>\n<li>輸出物品可作為虛設顯示物品，用於區分不同的包裝品項。</li>\n<li>您可以將 <strong>Packaged MultiBlock</strong> 加入您的模组整合包中。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>授權資訊</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>程式碼：MIT</li>\n</ul>",
